    "ROG actual client log [pak] mount order lists 8 paks with zz_supplement.pak last (this fill PR only; P1 stays at 7). The name was chosen so it should mount last (only 96-byte pak, sorts after the 7 PlayDH names), but that is an inference from FilesystemFileStorage; only this log is acceptance",
    "map smoke for 90/401/321 and the TYJ-151 maps loads with no FSOpenFile failure",
    "scripts/check-no-pak-changes.py passes: no *.pak path added or modified in the PR"
